	<names>
		<name lang="en">GH150E HMI Green Enhanced, 15 in, 1024 x 768, Ethernet, description view</name>
		<name lang="fr">GH150E IHM Green Enhanced, 15 pouces, 1024 x 768, Ethernet, vue description</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Kinco</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">GH150E</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">HMI Green Enhanced, 15 in, 1024 x 768, Ethernet</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco HMI Green GH (Enhanced) GH150E, 15 inch 1024 x 768 operator panel. The terminals are the power plug, the DB9 pins of the COM ports (pin number and signal), Ethernet and the USB ports; the pinout comes from the GL070E manual, check it against the datasheet of your model.</elementInformation>
